    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894890/extras/82102443b63afe1160c368de78217955.avif?t=1532620668\" /></div><br>Your name is Bill, a man that had a car accident in the countryside in West Virginia.Usually your trip would go smoothly,but this time you decided not to use the highway and you went for a nearby countryside road.A few miles from the point where you left the highway,you see an abandoned industrial zone,probably used in the 80s.<br>Later,you wake up from a car crash,not exactly knowing where you are.Before crashing you saw some big animal crossing the road,and then following you for a while.Right now your priorities are to get out of this place.<br><br><strong>  Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple but enjoyable gameplay.<br></li><li>Multiple endings.<br></li><li>Big enviroment.<br></li><li>Tense atmosphere of fear.</li></ul>",
